[background scene="res://Scenes/Cutscenes/Diner_Prologue.tscn" fade="0.0"]
join Foreground center [z_index="1"]
join Lizzy (Talking) righter [animation="Fade In"]
join Barb (Talking) leftmost [animation="Fade In" length="1.0"]
join Juniper (Talking) left [animation="Fade In" length="1.0" z_index="-1"]

Barb: You’re out of jam.
Lizzy: Hello to you too. Also I told you to stop taking those!
Lizzy: They’re for paying customers only.
Barb: You won’t have any paying customers if I review bomb you.
VO: Why do I even bother...
Juniper: Are you feeling any better? You seem to be back to your old self.
Lizzy: After the day I’ve had... It’s nice to see you two enjoying a quiet moment.
Lizzy: Uh, speaking of, where’s Noah?
Barb: The slammer.
Lizzy: ...
Lizzy: What?
Juniper: He’s in detention. Or was in detention.
do GameState.learn_fact("n_detention")
join Noah (Barb's Phone) center [animation="Bounce In" z_index="2"]
Noah: Hey, I’m here actually, just on the phone.
Noah: I’m in the hospital now.
VO: Oh yeah, he mentioned that yesterday over the phone.
Lizzy: What!! That’s too bad.
Noah: I’m feeling a little better.
Barb: Why he didn’t have his allergy meds on him, I have no idea.
Barb: If he was going to pull a stunt like that, he should have the brains to get away with it.
Noah: I can hear you!!
Barb: I know.
Lizzy: Compassionate as usual.
Barb: I’ve had a shit day, okay?
Barb: And the dress shop didn’t have the colour I wanted.
Barb: I had to settle for mauve. Ugh. It’ll totally clash with my corsage.
Lizzy: ...
Lizzy: What?
Juniper: that flower thing for your arm.
Lizzy: oh.
Lizzy: I still have no idea what that is.
Noah: It’s like a watch, but for girls.
Juniper: Are you going to hang out for a bit?
Lizzy: Uh, I gotta take care of something first, but I’ll be right back.
Juniper: ...
Barb: What ever.
Noah: Bye!!
